title: DVP Media
new-page: true

# Ripped from WilhelmVon500's amazing Volkspartei mod

@media
title: Media
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dvp_rally_post_timer > 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.labor_minister_party == "DVP" && Q.labor_affairs_post_timer > 0 && Q.strike_term_seen_post_timer > 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_enemies_post_timer > 0) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_media_post_timer > 0) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The DVP has the fewest supportive newspapers of any political party. This has been a significant weakness for them, and they are seeking to remedy this situation.

- @campaign
- @write_editorials
- @newspaper
- @newspaper_2
- @newspaper_3
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3

@campaign
title: The DVP will coordinate their campaign with supportive newspapers.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dvp_dissent > 0.2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_newspaper == 0 && Q.dvp_resources >= 3) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_newspaper > 0 && Q.dvp_newspaper <= 3 && Q.dvp_resources >= 1) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_newspaper > 3 && Q.dvp_radio == 0 && Q.dvp_resources >= 5) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_radio > 0 && Q.dvp_radio > 0 && Q.dvp_radio <= 3 && dvp_resources >= 2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_radio > 3) {
        return false;
    } else if  (Q.dvp_newspaper > 3) {
        return false;
    } else {
        return true;
    }
!}

The DVP's campaign media is mostly reaching the middle class who are already saturated with rightist propaganda, but it must be doing *something*, or at least that is what they hope.

@write_editorials
title: The DVP will have leading party figures write editorials in non-partisan newspapers.
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dvp_dissent > 0.2) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

This is not particularly effective in drawing voters, but the ability of their factions to debate over print may reduce internal dissent.

@newspaper
title: The DVP will launch their own newspaper, run by the party.
subtitle: -3 resources
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dvp_dissent > 0.2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_newspaper == 0 && Q.dvp_resources >= 3) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

The DVP has launched their own newspaper is extremely expensive, but effective in garnering support, especially among the middle class.

