@radio
title: The DVP will fund a radio station
subtitle: -5 resources
view-if: {!
    if (Q.dvp_dissent > 0.2) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_newspaper == 0 && Q.dvp_resources >= 3) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_newspaper > 0 && Q.dvp_newspaper <= 3 && Q.dvp_resources >= 1) {
        return false;
    } else if (Q.dvp_newspaper > 3 && Q.dvp_radio == 0 && Q.dvp_resources >= 5) {
        return true;
    } else {
        return false;
    }
!}

Their new radio station allows the DVP to connect to people in a more intimate setting than before, spreading the message of their party along with music and other popular content.

